{
  "slug": "vaper",
  "name": "Vaper",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Status line widget that shows how much water you've boiled with Claude today by converting daily token usage into joules and milliliters of water heated from 20°C to 100°C.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Commands** (3): `init`, `mode`, `uninstall`\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install vaper@claude-community` from `year-of-the/vaper`.\n\nA Claude Code status line widget that converts today's token energy into one of four absurd units: water boiled, Big Macs, 9mm rounds, or 2010-era BTC mined.",
